    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: AQ96 (CE-2319/CE-2320) - ONE soldier ordered forward across 115 m of open ground at a walking 2 m/s, into the fire of two hostile riflemen holding the far end and firing (CombatPosture, Stay; all immortal, so the reflex can be watched). He is alone: nobody covers him. Judge: (1) the moment the first rounds pass near him he runs CROUCHED at the rush speed (about 3 m/s), never upright at 2; (2) a near miss in the open drops him PRONE and he stops; (3) while rounds keep passing near him he stays down; (4) about 3 s after the fire on him lapses he crawls about 1.5 m sideways, then rises crouched and rushes on; (5) he does not drop again within 3 s of rising; within 3 m of his objective he no longer drops. Fail: he walks upright under fire, or springs up while still being fired on. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch uf-alone-under-fire"
  },
